{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "banner",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# 🧮 Rules Tables — the whole system on one wall\n\nEvery table in the Settlements rules, live-embedded from its source note. **Edit the rule, not the card** — change a value in `Basic Weapon System.md` and it changes here.\n\n**Costs shown are the printed vault prices** (100-point crew budget). The repo's `docs/POINTS-TABLE.md` v0.2 holds a rebuilt **1000-point** derivation that has *not* been propagated into these notes yet — the two scales disagree until it is.\n\nRe-run `scripts/build_rules_tables_canvas.py` after adding a new table.",
			"x": 0,
			"y": -620,
			"width": 1500,
			"height": 440,
			"color": "5"
		},
